PointForceLoad;1;23;;10.;0.;0.;-1.
PointForceLoad;1;24;;10.;0.;0.;-1.
# The regions (BSURF), the two contact sets (source region on target
# region, friction, search distances) and their union BCTADD 200
ContactElemSurface;1;1;2;3;4
ContactElemSurface;2;11
ContactElemSurface;3;21
ContactSet;101;2;1;0.1;0.;1.5
